// MidiInc fixture: global transpose + riff, then a drum import.
RndSeed 1
Time 4
Tempo 120
Transpose 2
Begin Solo
    Voice TenorSax
End
MidiInc File=egs/midi-inc/rec2.mid Solo=1,Riff Volume=90
Begin Drum
End
MidiInc File=egs/midi-inc/drum.mid Drum=1 Transpose=0 Volume=80 Start=1B End=24B
C
F
G7
C
z
